              "id" : "viz_0c414a7364bc4888954d1d8d3a88a775",
              "layer" : 1,
              "options" : {
                "content" : "## where\n\n**Keeps rows that match an expression.** Everything else is dropped.\n\n```tql\nwhere status != \"healthy\"\n```\n\n- Ops: `==`  `!=`  `<`  `<=`  `>`  `>=`  `contains`\n- Strings quoted; bare words are column names\n- Stateless — fuses cheaply into the pipeline",
                "content_type" : "markdown"
              },
              "type" : "text",
              "width" : 12
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "title" : "1 · where — filter rows"
