              "id" : "viz_097d498519ba4d97a328730194322239",
              "layer" : 1,
              "options" : {
                "content" : "## sort · head \/ tail\n\n**Order rows, then take the first\/last N.** Composes cleanly to give *top N*.\n\n```tql\nsort cpu_percent desc | head 10\n```\n\n- `sort` direction: `asc` (default) or `desc`\n- `head N` keeps the first N rows after sort\n- `tail N` keeps the last N\n- Both stateful — they need to see the whole stream",
                "content_type" : "markdown"
              },
              "type" : "text",
              "width" : 12
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "title" : "2 · sort + head — top 10 by CPU"
