              "id" : "viz_f25c36b14a0b414792608dee769d24f8",
              "layer" : 1,
              "options" : {
                "content" : "## select\n\n**Keep only the columns you list.** SQL `SELECT col1, col2`.\n\n```tql\nselect hostname, status, cpu_percent, memory_percent, region\n```\n\n- Order in `select` sets the displayed column order\n- `select *` keeps everything (the default if you skip this stage)\n- `col as alias` renames in flight",
                "content_type" : "markdown"
