              "id" : "viz_d425f09a8a27431ba5ce4f9bbf808462",
              "layer" : 1,
              "options" : {
                "content" : "## eval\n\n**Adds a computed column.** Compute a derived KPI, then sort, filter, or group on it.\n\n```tql\neval pressure = cpu_percent + memory_percent * 0.5\n| select hostname, cpu_percent, memory_percent, pressure\n| sort pressure desc | head 12\n```\n\n- Arithmetic: `+`  `-`  `*`\n- ⚠︎  `\/` is reserved by the regex tokenizer — use `* 0.5` instead of `\/ 2`\n- References other columns by name\n- Multiple `eval` stages chain; later stages see earlier columns",
                "content_type" : "markdown"
              },
              "type" : "text",
              "width" : 12
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "title" : "4 · eval — derived columns"
