              "id" : "viz_40b7aab135aa4bfe8f873d9ba847c1d6",
              "layer" : 1,
              "options" : {
                "content" : "## stats … by\n\n**Aggregate rows into groups.** One output row per unique combination of the `by` columns.\n\n```tql\nstats count(servers),\n      avg(cpu_percent)    as avg_cpu,\n      avg(memory_percent) as avg_mem,\n      max(disk_percent)   as max_disk\nby region\n```\n\n- Aggregates: `count`  `sum`  `avg`  `min`  `max`\n- `… as name` sets the output column name\n- Surfaces `group_by_fields` metadata so charts auto-dimension",
                "content_type" : "markdown"
