              "id" : "viz_c1dcdfe6674d45069979e44b8668d619",
              "layer" : 1,
              "options" : {
                "content" : "## extract\n\n**Pull named groups out of a string with regex.** Each `(?<name>…)` becomes a new column.\n\n```tql\nextract alert_id \/alert-(?<alert_hash>[a-f0-9]+)\/\n| select alert_hash, hostname, severity, message\n```\n\n- Source field stays unless you `select` it out\n- Rows that don't match are dropped\n- Stateless — fuses with neighbouring stages",
                "content_type" : "markdown"
