              "layer" : 1,
              "options" : {
                "content" : "## pivot\n\n**Long-form → wide-form.** Each unique series value becomes its own column.\n\n```tql\npivot host cpu\n```\n\n**Before**\n```\n_time, host,  cpu\nt1,    web-1, 63.6\nt1,    web-2, 71.2\n```\n\n**After**\n```\n_time, web-1, web-2\nt1,    63.6,  71.2\n```",
