              "id" : "viz_aa941de5d522479b97514838e4af2d7c",
              "layer" : 1,
              "options" : {
                "content" : "## parsetime\n\n**Turn a string or numeric column into a real `Date`.** Downstream stages can sort chronologically and charts pick it up as the time axis.\n\n```tql\nparsetime timestamp iso8601 | sort timestamp desc\n```\n\n- Formats: `auto`, `seconds`, `milliseconds`, `iso8601`, or custom `\"dd\/MMM\/yyyy:HH:mm:ss Z\"`\n- `auto` guesses by magnitude: large numbers → ms, small → s, else ISO 8601\n- Stateless — drops in anywhere upstream of a chart or sort",
                "content_type" : "markdown"
              },
              "type" : "text",
              "width" : 12
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "title" : "8 · parsetime — typed timestamps"
