              "id" : "viz_f7d45bf72e654ce7a11e761cfbb66f72",
              "layer" : 1,
              "options" : {
                "content" : "## pivot — composite series\n\n**Pivot on two (or more) fields at once.** Join series fields with `+` and the column names become the values joined with `:`.\n\n```tql\nstats avg(cpu_percent) as avg_cpu by region, role\n| pivot region+role avg_cpu\n```\n\n- Output columns: `<region>:<role>` (e.g. `eu-west-1:api`)\n- Pairs cleanly with `stats … by` to summarise multi-dimensional data\n- Same `+` works for 3+ fields: `pivot region+role+tier value`\n- When 2+ value fields are also given, names become `<region>:<role>:<valueField>`",
                "content_type" : "markdown"
              },
              "type" : "text",
              "width" : 12
            }
          ]
        }
